{"hw":"προσέχω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">προσέχω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">προσέχω</span> (<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Cypr.</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ποέχω</span> (q.v.)) and <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">προσίσχω</span>: <span class=\"lex-gram\">aor.</span> <span class=\"gk\">προσέσχον</span>:— <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">hold to, offer</b>, <span class=\"gk\">προσέσχε μαζὸν [δράκοντι</span>] <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ch.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">531</span> </span>; <b class=\"lex-tr\">hold against</b>, [ <span class=\"gk\">τὴν ἀσπίδα] προσῖσχε πρὸς τὸ δάπεδον</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.200</span> </span>; <b class=\"lex-tr\">apply</b>, <span class=\"gk\">χλιάσματα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hp.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Mul.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.129</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> <span class=\"gk\">π. ναῦν</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">bring</b> a ship <b class=\"lex-tr\">to port</b>, <span class=\"gk\">προσσχόντες τὰς νέας</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">9.99</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">Μαλέᾳ προσίσχων πρῷραν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Or.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">362</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τίς σε προσέσχε.. χρεία</span>; <b class=\"lex-tr\">brought</b> thee <b class=\"lex-tr\">to land</b> here? <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ph.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">236</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">&lt;ναῦν&gt; πρὸς τὴν γῆν προσσχεῖν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.C.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">42.4</span> </span>: more freq. without <span class=\"gk\">ναῦν</span>, <b class=\"lex-tr\">put in, touch at</b> a place, <span class=\"gk\">προσσχεῖν ἐς Τύρον, ἐς τὴν Σάμον</span>, etc., <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.2</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.48</span> </span>, al.; <span class=\"gk\">πρὸς τὴν Σίφνον προσῖσχον</span> ib.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">58</span> </span>: c. dat. loci, <span class=\"gk\">π. τῇ γῇ</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.156</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τῆς νήσου τοῖς ἐσχάτοις</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.30</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">Λιβύῃ κατὰ τὴν Μαυρουσίαν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Plu.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Sert.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">7</span> </span>: c. acc. loci, <span class=\"gk\">τίνι στόλῳ προσέσχες τήνδε γῆν</span>; <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ph.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">244</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Plb.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.9.2</span> </span>: abs., <b class=\"lex-tr\">land</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.182</span> </span>, etc.: with words added, <span class=\"gk\">πλέων δι' Ἑλλησπόντου π. ἐς Κύζικον</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.76</span> </span>, cf. <span class=